    thinking: "**Analyzing Price Ranges**\n\nI\'ve examined the typical price ranges, noting the observed fluctuations between 500,000 and 5,000,000+ Toman. I\'ve concluded that establishing a free shipping threshold, for example, at 2,000,000 Toman, is a logical and standard approach.\n\n\n**Implementing Free Shipping Bar**\n\nI\'m now focused on implementing the free shipping progress bar. My plan is to add a dynamic, styled banner above the cart items, featuring a progress bar, remaining amount message, and celebratory badge. This will enhance the user experience and seamlessly fit with Iranian eCommerce design. I\'ve located the appropriate components and imports within `Cart.tsx` and am double-checking for shipping icons in the header or order summary.\n\n\n**Calculating Shipping Thresholds**\n\nI\'m now calculating the free shipping logic. I\'m focusing on defining the `FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD` and determining `amountLeft`, `progressPercentage`, and `isFreeShipping` values. The calculations are straightforward, involving `Math.max` and `Math.min` functions. I\'m also planning the correct messaging based on free shipping eligibility, including icons such as truck or checkmark, and appropriate styling for the progress bar.\n\n\n"
